<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Selected k and justification: k = 2 was selected because it gives the highest silhouette score by a clear margin, and because the t-SNE projection of the ground truth shows two well-separated super-groups \(static and dynamic activities\). The elbow suggests k = 3 as a secondary candidate, but the silhouette score is already noticeably lower there. Choosing k = 6 to match the six activity labels would have given a silhouette of only 0.110, showing that six compact, well-separated clusters do not exist in this feature space.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [12]
>>
